  "details": "It would be really useful to be able to build avatar systems based on your current status. I would love to add an indicator to my avatar which describes if I'm Blue/Green vs Orange/Red.\n\nThis would also allow avatar creators to make some safety systems, such as having a minimum amount of clothing enabled when the user is Blue or Green.\n\nI can imagine this as a simple `Int` which is then readable by the avatar's animators.",
